this project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by either
company.

Anyone redistributing iqdraw with that data included should satisfy
themselves that VEX's terms allow it. See the "Licensing and the bundled CAD
data" section of README.md; `--detail simple` runs the whole tool without
touching the bundled meshes at all.
